        <zone forceUpdate="true" h="5889" id="10205" type-v2="text" w="28125" x="3611" y="49889">
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor="#94a3b8" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="8">Closed House sustained HDP &gt;90% for 30.2 consecutive weeks. Open House never reached 90% weekly average, driving a cumulative 96.2 egg/hen gap.</run></formatted-text>
