          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor="#94a3b8" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="8">Closed FCR 2.096 vs Open 2.420 (0.324 gap) yields Rp 2,550/kg feed savings, preserving Rp 1.5-1.7B in working capital per 30,000-bird flock.</run></formatted-text>
        </zone>
